{"3279520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anime Girls: Stellar Invasion", "steam_appid": 3279520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blast Off into a Galactic Journey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279520/extras/5ab9710755209148d3d3a9af5c53864b.poster.avif?t=1773745139\" width=614 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279520/extras/5ab9710755209148d3d3a9af5c53864b.webm?t=1773745139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279520/extras/5ab9710755209148d3d3a9af5c53864b.mp4?t=1773745139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a cute, unstoppable anime girl in this thrilling third-person shooter, as you venture through space to complete high-risk missions on space stations, distant planets, and beyond. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279520/extras/0ecf46035f70500709473fcdcc5be579.poster.avif?t=1773745139\" width=614 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279520/extras/0ecf46035f70500709473fcdcc5be579.webm?t=1773745139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279520/extras/0ecf46035f70500709473fcdcc5be579.mp4?t=1773745139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the action across three exciting modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shooter Mode</strong>: Engage in fast-paced combat on foot, using a variety of weapons and gadgets to defeat enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279520/extras/a9a4c3e924c26bc314d9aacb1ee5d3cf.poster.avif?t=1773745139\" width=614 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279520/extras/a9a4c3e924c26bc314d9aacb1ee5d3cf.webm?t=1773745139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279520/extras/a9a4c3e924c26bc314d9aacb1ee5d3cf.mp4?t=1773745139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mecha Mode</strong>: Pilot a powerful mecha and crush robots in epic mechanical showdowns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279520/extras/08ffd63b243cfd0c174fac576d4643a7.poster.avif?t=1773745139\" width=614 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279520/extras/08ffd63b243cfd0c174fac576d4643a7.webm?t=1773745139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279520/extras/08ffd63b243cfd0c174fac576d4643a7.mp4?t=1773745139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jet Mode</strong>: Take the fight to the skies, piloting a spaceship in breathtaking space battles or planetary dogfights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset